# ============================================================================
# 绝对不要提交的产物 / NEVER commit these
#
# keybox.xml 里含有设备私钥。一旦提交，任何人都能用它冒充你的设备做
# key attestation。发布前务必确认这些文件不在暂存区。
#
# keybox.xml contains your device private key. Committing it lets anyone
# impersonate your device's key attestation. Always verify these files are
# not staged before publishing.
# ============================================================================
